{"path":"numeric/complex/log10","title":"std::log10(std::complex)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>log10<small>(std::complex)</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/complex/log10","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Computes complex common (base 10) logarithm of a complex value z with a branch cut along the negative real axis.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/complex\">&lt;complex&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> log10<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> z <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Computes complex common (base <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">10</span></span></code>) logarithm of a complex value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> with a branch cut along the negative real axis.\n</p><p>The behavior of this function is equivalent to <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/log\">std::log</a>(z) / <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/log\">std::log</a>(T(10))</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> z\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> complex value\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Complex common logarithm of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;complex&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> z<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// r = 0, θ = pi / 2</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"2 * log10\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> z <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu16\">2.0</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/log10\"><span class=\"kw1333\">std::<span class=\"me2\">log10</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> z2<span class=\"br0\">(</span>sqrt<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">2.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, sqrt<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">2.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// r = 1, θ = pi / 4</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"4 * log10\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> z2 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu16\">4.0</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/log10\"><span class=\"kw1333\">std::<span class=\"me2\">log10</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z2<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> z3<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu16\">100.0</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// r = 100, θ = pi</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"log10\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> z3 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/log10\"><span class=\"kw1333\">std::<span class=\"me2\">log10</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z3<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> z4<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu16\">100.0</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// the other side of the cut</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"log10\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> z4 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/log10\"><span class=\"kw1333\">std::<span class=\"me2\">log10</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z4<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" \"</span>\n                 <span class=\"st0\">\"(the other side of the cut)<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>\n                 <span class=\"st0\">\"(note: pi / log(10) = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/acos\"><span class=\"kw1345\">std::<span class=\"me2\">acos</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/log\"><span class=\"kw1332\">std::<span class=\"me2\">log</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">10.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>2 * log10(0,1) = (0,1.36438)\n4 * log10(0.707107,0.707107) = (0,1.36438)\nlog10(-100,0) = (2,1.36438)\nlog10(-100,-0) = (2,-1.36438) (the other side of the cut)\n(note: pi / log(10) = 1.36438)</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/log\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>log<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::complex)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  complex natural logarithm with the branch cuts along the negative real axis <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/log10\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>log10</span><span>log10f</span><span>log10l</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes common (base <span class=\"texhtml\">10</span>) logarithm (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\log_{10}{x}}\">log<sub>10</sub>(x)</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray/log10\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>log10<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::valarray)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  applies the function <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/log10\">std::log10</a></span> to each element of valarray <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/complex","title":"std::complex"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::log10(std::complex)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Computes complex common (base 10) logarithm of a complex value z with a branch cut along the negative real axis."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"z"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Complex common logarithm of z."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"log(std::complex)","note":"complex natural logarithm with the branch cuts along the negative real axis"},{"label":"log10, log10f, log10l","note":"computes common (base 10) logarithm (log10(x))"},{"label":"log10(std::valarray)","note":"applies the function std::log10 to each element of valarray"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":261,"codeBlockCount":2}
